Z||000000||AgaricX||11-13-2001||02:19 AM||||Int he neverending quest to make my baby presentable, I've been pursuing spoIler options.<P>I believe I have seen some 99-2000 Musting wings used, have I not?  Doesn anyone have any pictures?<P>What about the earlier (95-96) wings and even earlier (90-91 style)?<P>Though I really dislike mustangs as a whole because of their insane proliferation with the 16-20yr and middle aged crowd... I think that a wing may help put a unique spin on the Fiero.<P>Does anyone have any pics of any of these wings on a Fiero?  Thanks!<P>------------------<BR>85 SE 3800<BR>Body Work in Progress<BR>Pic to follow when it's not an eyesore.||||reg||12
